<title>USA: Andersons Inc Q4 net rises slightly.</title>
<headline>Andersons Inc Q4 net rises slightly.</headline>
<dateline>MAUMEE, Ohio 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Andersons, Inc.</p>
<p>			Consolidated Statements of Income</p>
<p>			   (Unaudited)</p>
<p>				  Three Months Ended  Year Ended</p>
<p> (in thousands,	     December 31		 December 31</p>
<p>   except for EPS)	 1996	1995	1996	 1995</p>
<p>Grain sales and revenues</p>
<p>			    $209,940 $232,634   $700,326   $660,121</p>
